=B4ng qua m=E1=BB=99t Server trung t=C3=A2m b=E1=BA=B1ng giao th=E1=BB=A9c =
TCP. D=E1=BB=B1 =C3=A1n h=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Bng =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn vi=E1=BB=87c v=
=E1=BA=ADn d=E1=BB=A5ng v=C3=A0 luy=E1=BB=87n t=E1=BA=ADp c=C3=A1c ki=E1=BA=
=BFn th=E1=BB=A9c c=E1=BB=A7a c=C3=A1c m=C3=B4n =C4=91=C3=A3 h=E1=BB=8Dc.
<br>
V=E1=BB=9Bi t=E1=BA=A7m nh=C3=ACn =C4=91=E1=BB=83 ph=C3=A1t tri=E1=BB=83n m=
=E1=BB=99t =E1=BB=A9ng d=E1=BB=A5ng chat g=E1=BB=8Dn nh=E1=BA=B9, d=E1=BB=
=85 c=C3=A0i =C4=91=E1=BA=B7t v=C3=A0 th=E1=BB=B1c h=C3=A0nh. C=E1=BA=A5u t=
r=C3=BAc ch=C6=B0=C6=A1ng tr=C3=ACnh =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c ph=C3=A2n th=C3=
=A0nh c=C3=A1c th=C6=B0 m=E1=BB=A5c nh=C6=B0 UI, Client, Server =C4=91=E1=
