=A9ng nh=C6=B0 th=E1=BB=B1c h=C3=A0nh thay =C4=91=E1=BB=95i, c=E1=BA=A3i ti=
=E1=BB=83n.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c81befd532e2" id=3D"UDM_08_Chat_TCP_Client_Server-5.T=C3=AD=
nhn=C4=83ngv=C3=A0h=E1=BA=A1nch=E1=BA=BF"><strong>5.T=C3=ADnh n=C4=83ng v=
