=83ng</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6990696aae7d">3.1 T=E1=BB=95ng quan</p>
<ul local-id=3D"41e9de18bb78">
<li local-id=3D"442c91818451">
<p local-id=3D"536c3832d727">Giao di=E1=BB=87n ch=C3=ADnh (Main GUI) c=E1=
=BB=A7a =E1=BB=A9ng d=E1=BB=A5ng UDM_08_ChatApp =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c thi=
=E1=BA=BFt k=E1=BA=BF nh=E1=BA=B1m cung c=E1=BA=A5p m=C3=B4i tr=C6=B0=E1=BB=
=9Dng t=C6=B0=C6=A1ng t=C3=A1c tr=E1=BB=B1c quan, gi=C3=BAp ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=
=9Di d=C3=B9ng th=E1=BB=B1c hi=E1=BB=87n c=C3=A1c thao t=C3=A1c tr=C3=B2 ch=
uy=E1=BB=87n th=C3=B4ng qua =E1=BB=A9ng d=E1=BB=A5ng</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6243f184b536">
<p local-id=3D"909e6bf2a01a">C=C3=A1c ch=E1=BB=A9c n=C4=83ng ch=C3=ADnh c=
=E1=BB=A7a giao di=E1=BB=87n bao g=E1=BB=93m:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8a4a9f3e-f766-4906-bdbc-aac175c9a9ef">
<li local-id=3D"a88588a6-f1fe-482c-857c-1bfae6b1f3b5">
<p local-id=3D"90e1660795d4">K=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i v=C3=A0 ng=E1=BA=AFt k=
=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i v=E1=BB=9Bi Server.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"8b2dfdf5-6a24-4cd6-ac06-00003eccaf9c">
<p local-id=3D"2bef4d86b81b">Hi=E1=BB=83n th=E1=BB=8B tr=E1=BA=A1ng th=C3=
=A1i k=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"88db4881-7ab9-4876-a316-4d899fda0b36">
<p local-id=3D"5a0be840bda3">Hi=E1=BB=83n th=E1=BB=8B v=C3=A0 t=C3=ACm ki=
=E1=BA=BFm danh s=C3=A1ch ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng.</p>
