<p local-id=3D"645b73ee8a5e"><strong>1.1 Ki=E1=BB=83m th=E1=BB=AD ch=E1=BB=
=A9c n=C4=83ng</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"76791a0cffbc"><strong>TC_01 =E2=80=93 TCP Connection</strong=
></p>
