<p local-id=3D"4d0938bd15a6"><strong>2.2 M=E1=BB=A9c =C4=91=E1=BB=99</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"40a748a22c76"><strong>2.2.1. Ki=E1=BB=83m th=E1=BB=AD =C4=91=
=C6=A1n v=E1=BB=8B (Unit Testing)</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"1241ad97d3fc">Ki=E1=BB=83m th=E1=BB=AD =C4=91=C6=A1n v=E1=BB=
=8B t=E1=BA=ADp trung =C4=91=C3=A1nh gi=C3=A1 t=C3=ADnh ch=C3=ADnh x=C3=A1c=
 c=E1=BB=A7a t=E1=BB=ABng ch=E1=BB=A9c n=C4=83ng ho=E1=BA=B7c th=C3=A0nh ph=
=E1=BA=A7n ri=C3=AAng bi=E1=BB=87t, =C4=91=E1=BA=A3m b=E1=BA=A3o c=C3=A1c t=
h=C3=A0nh ph=E1=BA=A7n ho=E1=BA=A1t =C4=91=E1=BB=99ng =C4=91=C3=BAng theo t=
hi=E1=BA=BFt k=E1=BA=BF tr=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Bc khi =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c t=C3=
=ADch h=E1=BB=A3p v=C3=A0o h=E1=BB=87 th=E1=BB=91ng.</p>
<p local-id=3D"50c6b2199267">C=C3=A1c n=E1=BB=99i dung ki=E1=BB=83m th=E1=
=BB=AD bao g=E1=BB=93m:</p>
