 Giao di=E1=BB=87n tr=E1=BB=B1c quan, d=E1=BB=85 thao t=C3=A1c v=C3=A0 h=E1=
=BB=97 tr=E1=BB=A3 ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng th=E1=BB=B1c hi=E1=BB=87n c=
=C3=A1c ch=E1=BB=A9c n=C4=83ng th=C3=B4ng qua GUI.</p>
