 CMake, MinGW, v=C3=A0 SQLite =C4=91=E1=BB=83 sao l=C6=B0u ph=E1=BA=A7n l=
=E1=BB=8Bch s=E1=BB=AD tr=C3=B2 chuy=E1=BB=87n.</p>
