<p local-id=3D"cd771b6f8b90"></p>
<p local-id=3D"08078f5b0b73"><strong>3.1 T=E1=BB=95ng quan</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"faba209102b3">=E1=BB=A8ng d=E1=BB=A5ng c=C3=B3 hai vai tr=C3=
=B2 v=E1=BA=ADn h=C3=A0nh. Ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di qu=E1=BA=A3n tr=E1=BB=8B kh=
=E1=BB=9Fi ch=E1=BA=A1y Server tr=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Bc =C4=91=E1=BB=83 t=E1=BA=
=A1o =C4=91i=E1=BB=83m ti=E1=BA=BFp nh=E1=BA=ADn k=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i. N=
g=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9ng kh=E1=BB=9Fi ch=E1=BA=A1y Client, nh=E1=BA=ADp =
=C4=91=E1=BB=8Ba ch=E1=BB=89 IP v=C3=A0 c=E1=BB=95ng c=E1=BB=A7a Server, sa=
u =C4=91=C3=B3 k=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i =C4=91=E1=BB=83 s=E1=BB=AD d=E1=BB=
=A5ng c=C3=A1c ch=E1=BB=A9c n=C4=83ng tr=C3=B2 chuy=E1=BB=87n. =C4=90=E1=BB=
=83 c=C3=A1c m=C3=A1y t=C3=ADnh kh=C3=A1c nhau giao ti=E1=BA=BFp, ch=C3=BAn=
g c=E1=BA=A7n k=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c v=E1=BB=9Bi nh=
au qua m=E1=BA=A1ng v=C3=A0 c=E1=BB=95ng TCP c=E1=BB=A7a Server.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c0327aa97dd5"><strong>3.2 Giao di=E1=BB=87n ch=C3=ADnh v=C3=
=A0 c=C3=A1c ch=E1=BB=A9c n=C4=83ng</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5274cccbb98e"><strong>3.2.2. K=E1=BA=BFt n=E1=BB=91i t=E1=BB=
=AB Client</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8c4c92a52557">
<li local-id=3D"7c5f037aaab1">
<p local-id=3D"19f900fbb55c">Kh=E1=BB=9Fi ch=E1=BA=A1y =E1=BB=A9ng d=E1=BB=
=A5ng Client tr=C3=AAn thi=E1=BA=BFt b=E1=BB=8B ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di d=C3=B9n=
g.</p>
